[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一気にいくわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's hit them with everything we've got!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あれ？\u3000誰もいない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? There's no one here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "好都合かも。ブレスレットを回収しよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That might work in our favor. Let's collect the bracelets!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、あれ。どこにも無い……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... They're not here anywhere..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういえば、運び屋に運ばせるって言ってたわね。\nもう持ち出されちゃったのかも",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come to think of it, they mentioned having couriers transport them. They might have already moved them out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もうっ。仕事が早いなぁ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh, talk about efficient!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "団長の捜索とブレスレットの回収。\n二手に分かれよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should split up—one group to find the leader, another to recover the bracelets."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、あたしたちが運び屋を追うわ。\n機動力重視よ。まっかせて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then we'll go after the couriers! Speed is key here. Leave it to us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちも、逃亡者の追跡なら経験があるし、\nきっと役に立つはず",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're experienced in tracking down fugitives. I'm sure we can help."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "抵抗されたら、ぶっ飛ばしてやるわね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If they resist, I'll blast them into next week!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴァレリアなら石に触っても大丈夫みたいだしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And since Valeria's immune to the stones, that should work in our favor."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういうこと。力持ちだから、取り戻したら\n全部運んじゃうわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly. Once we get them back, I'll carry the whole lot myself!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頼もしい！\u3000みんな、よろしくね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's reassuring! Thanks, everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まっかせて～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし、それじゃあ、アタシたちも団長を探そう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright then, let's go find that leader!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]